{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_511_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_511_rs_02_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "e3b164655eead6831dc5b8d14e311caeebbe021cf14b8886309143369f575eb5", "ja": "でもでも{$P$}ちゃんのおかげで\nす～っごく楽しいライブが出来たよ！　ありがとね♪", "zh": "可是可是，多亏了{$P$}，\n我们才能办成一场超——开心的演唱会！谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
